    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Sakura_Review:Sakura_Review_019:ee915ce2",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_Sakura_Review",
        "key": "Sakura_Review_019",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Sakura_Review:Sakura_Review_019:ee915ce2",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Sakura_Review:Sakura_Review_019:ee915ce2",
        "jp_sha256": "4dd3d937fbb63ee291294c098d6e807cc361a2ae6ed387e407ff5962d1fbf85f",
        "official_en_sha256": "e636c25c4d3b3c2b1a1ec81ef5185073173bae47c0d751353c1d0d0e4fb5eb35"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "このままでは被害が大きくなってしまう。\r\nそう危惧した常闇は、早期終戦の作戦を立案。\r\nワシらはそれに乗ったのじゃ。",
        "official_en": "To avoid further unnecessary bloodshed, Umbra devised a\ngambit—to which us Sworn Eight all agreed upon—to swiftly bring about the end to the war.",
        "real_en": "Veritas of the Dark feared the damage would only grow if the war continued, so he devised a plan to end it swiftly. We agreed to it."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
