        "official_en": "The Sworn Eight consisted of Umbra, Lux, Ignis, Aether, Tellus, Alluvion, Gelidus, and myself—Tonitus.",
        "real_en": "In Paladia, the Sworn Eight were\r\nVeritas of the Dark, Radiance Veritas, Inferno Veritas, Heavenly Wind Veritas,\r\nSovereign Earth Veritas, Water Bloom Veritas, Frost Blade Veritas, and Thunderclap Veritas."
